Clinical Course: Sinus tachycardia from stimulants is completely reversible once the caffeine washes out of the system and adequate sleep is achieved.

SAFETY-NETTING ADVICE

Stop all caffeine immediately. Practice deep breathing. Seek emergency care if you develop severe chest pain or feel like you are going to faint.

